        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6c05d377-98ad-427b-8496-72ecc99ffdc0\",\"review_text\":\"Trash. Takes an eternity to cancel sub and horrible service\"},{\"review_id\":\"79a7d97f-4a46-42e1-8159-dbcac7160044\",\"review_text\":\"Don't download West one song play 30 seconds five ads...\"},{\"review_id\":\"3eeb6c8e-7e30-420e-b897-a8bad330a3fb\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing I use it every day\"},{\"review_id\":\"5f62ffe2-bf49-4824-ad02-71867d60d9df\",\"review_text\":\"Great, just wish I didn't have to subscribe to make the app functional. If you don't there seems to be more commercial time than song time.....\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea888ed7-5168-4947-bdb6-e4ef4088cb0e\",\"review_text\":\"Adipolyyy 👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍😉😉😉☺️☺️☺️☺️☺️☺️\"},{\"review_id\":\"2cde3a67-37bf-45e5-bace-a691d9386bde\",\"review_text\":\"This WAS the best music app. It had features like no others. Now it's worse than YouTube Music.Whoever decided to remove the repeat and back button should be fired and you just lost a customer\"},{\"review_id\":\"36b0b9aa-26c7-492c-b6a3-2ef54c0bf779\",\"review_text\":\"Very good sound quality 🎉🎉\"},{\"review_id\":\"d74bbe88-acb1-441e-8b50-11c3f1ef33af\",\"review_text\":\"Really good!! It has all the latest and the oldest songs from all around the world and available in every language with all the popular artists to listen to, 10/10 would recommend!! 🤩\"},{\"review_id\":\"8602da72-c09d-446a-b637-d14fc2fb998e\",\"review_text\":\"It's gotten terrible you now need to pay money to skip songs and when there is one song you want to listen to you have to go through an entire list! You don't need to make as much money because you stopped sponsoring Barcelona\"},{\"review_id\":\"3026c4c6-f16c-43a1-88bd-e6855ba7fa7c\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this app 🤬🖕🖕\"}]}"
